        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "3rd card is up to you, Truth 0/1 for 5 Moral equivalent or Friends for Shield/Dmg or both\n8/9 Blessings if you have E4 you can instead go 2/3 OUAT vs Protect\nProtect Us with -1 AP is great\nFriends/Truth/Garden all have their Niche as the 3rd card, or more\nGarden is the default because its an Upgrade\nTruth is equivalent to 5 Moral, if you can Cycle it\nFriends although an Upgrade, adds a card back in so isn't nessicarily good"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Cycle 0/+3 | Protect Us 4 aka AP Divine"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
