        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Protect 1 + Pack Doggos can be used individually to keep digging\nOr to be a burst of Draw + Damage with Protect Us stacked and triggering together\nYou could also instead go 4 Protect instead, (Especially good with E4)\n11 Blessings"
          }
        }
