    {
      "id": "clara-rachel-erica-eishlen-wilhelma",
      "title": {
        "en": "Clara | Rachel | Erica | Eishlen | Wilhelma"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Clara: Broken Ego, makes ADHD into a sub healer and also 20-40% Multi, shes great\nRachel: Always good Ego Skill + Free CounterAttack even without Teddy\nErica: More agressive Rachel, but I rather have the Draw 1 cheap Ego\nEishlen: Stat Stick\nWilhelma Stat Stick"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "starlight-tetra",
      "title": {
        "en": "Starlight | Tetra"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Blessings easy stack Starlight\nIncreases Extra Attack and Counter Damage ONLY, not base card damage"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Glory | Tetra | Executioner's"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Adel doesn't create Exhaust Skill cards so she will run out eventually\nBut OUAT counts while you still can use it, for a more universal way of buffing over Starlight\nExe can replace Tetra if you wanna build her as more DPS for some reason"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Tetra | Executioner's | Flex"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "2/2/2 for dediccated DPS"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "potential-priority",
      "title": {
        "en": "Potential Priority"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Ego Manifestation"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\nMaking Garden 0 Cost is nice, but it isn't important for general use (draw)\nWhy does this also not add Blessing? Huh?\nE2:\nGrants Adel's team up to 30% Multi Damage, It's okay, but a dedicated buffer is better\nE3:\nBuffs Ego Skill Uselss\nE4:\nYou can forgo more OUAT for more Protect Us\nE5:\nPotential levels, not very important\nE6:\nNow the buff is up to 40% Multi, but also way easier to stack\n+1 Draw each turn as well, this is really good"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
