        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "OUAT 1, 1 cost is bad, cantrips and is 6 blessings (I'm not suire if it can try to rebless cards)\nOUAT 2: Allows you to scuplt your starting hand as well as is 2 Blessings, VERY GOOD\nOUAT 3: 0 cost, enables Quietus, and 6 blessings\nOUAT 4: Potentially alot of Draw, but then you're left without AP, not good\nOUAT 5: 5 Blessing each turn, but why would you want to make it this way? Protect 4?"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1055_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "3/5"
