            {
              "cardId": "c_1055_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Friends 1: Doggo does up to 1200% more at max Blessings (generally 720%)\nFriends 2: Allows you to play 2 Teddy a turn potentially, or just 1 for free\nFriends 3: Deals big damage, but also adds 3 more card to cycle through, requires Protect 1\nFriends 4: Just allows Adel to get Counter\nFriends 5:Swap between Doggie/Teddit (DMG/Shield), base shield/dmg is higher\nDoesn't actually Deck Thin since it creates a permanent card to replace itself"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
