          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Protect 1: 3 draw, per 3 blessing cards, very good rate Cycle +2 (Semi Card Tutoring)\nProtect 2: This is kinda a discard reload engine, but also requires setup that you gotta think of\nProtect 3: RNG Costs is no good Cycle +2\nProtect 4: Cantrips, can go +1 and also get AP Divine, its good Cycle +0/1\nProtect 5: Only draws Adel cards, not really recommended Cycle +1"
          }
