          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Truth 1: Honestly, worse then a good Neutral like Vuln, Moral, Draw, AP\nTruth 2: This is +1 sometimes, but when would your blessing cards be in DISCARD\nTruth 3\" Just increases Friends DMG/Shield, funny ig\nTruth 4: IG its a way to make Adel DPS\nTruth 5: What is this trash\nTruth 0, honestly just getting a good Neutral Epiphany is your best bet here"
