          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Attack Persona"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Persona 1: Def Based + Applies Vuln, best out of Attacks\nPersona 2: Potentially CounterAttack, but usually nothing burger\nPersona cards themself are bad, but the engravings are good"
          }
        }
      ]
